e('With N disks of capacity C:','For equal disks of capacity C and N active disks, ignoring metadata/reserves and assuming healthy arrays, the table gives ideal capacity and isolated uncached small-write operations. RAID10 here means conventional two-way mirrored pairs:','ModelRAID10/Linuxvariants.',rr)
e('- Random reads, any level: about **1,200** IOPS.','- Random reads in an ideal balanced workload: up to about **1,200** IOPS; actual scheduling and layout can reduce this.','Notanyleveltrue throughput.',rr)
