f(10,'explanation','Both concurrency and bandwidth can limit throughput.800000×4096 is3.2768GB/s, far beyond SATA6Gb/s payload capability even before considering its32-command depth.','Onlyconcurrencyfalse/SATAcap.',nv,o=2)
